    - target: {fileID: 285405916822844953, guid: 19a5c6c801b91454aab4e792d4d95d66,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: guessWhoInstructions
      value: "We are going to play Guess Who. I want you to pick one character from
        this list. I will ask yes/no questions to find out who you are. Only answer
        with \u2018Yes\u2019, \u2018No\u2019, or \u2018I can\u2019t tell.\u2019 Keep
        your choice the same until the end. When I\u2019m ready, I\u2019ll make my
        guess, and you will tell me if I\u2019m correct. Characters: Anna (blonde
        hair, red hat), Ben (brown hair, glasses), Clara (black hair, earrings),
        David (bald, beard),  Ella (red hair, freckles, glasses), Frank (blonde hair,
        mustache, blue cap), Grace (brown curly hair), Henry  (black short hair,
        glasses), Isabel (long blonde hair, necklace), Jack (black hair, beard),
        Karen (short brown hair,  glasses, earrings), Leo (red hair, freckles, cap).
        As your answer to this specific query I want you to answer the name  You've
        chosen and their characteristics since I have to save it on the system. However
        from now on never say the name."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
